_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 6
---
order: 6
---
short_label: VII.6
---
statement: If a number is parts of a number, and another is the same parts of another, then the sum is also the same parts of the sum that the one is of the one.
---
proof:

Let the number *AB* be parts of the number *C,* and another number *DE* be the same parts of another number *F* that *AB* is of *C.*

I say that the sum of *AB* and *DE* is also the same parts of the sum of *C* and *F* that *AB* is of *C.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="150" height="210" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="VII.6 diagram" src="propVII6.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
